"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"SlimNazi","author_id":"410902222","text":"2. Why is it in the news?\nRecent reports from China show a surge in respiratory infections, including HMPV, alongside influenza and RSV. While hospitals are busy, experts say this increase is consistent with seasonal trend","in_corpus":true,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":6,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1876269772884910291","conversation_id":"1876269772884910291"},{"id":"1876269782800244979","x":1.9e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1736172550,"iso":"2025-01-06T14:09:10Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"SlimNazi","author_id":"410902222","text":"3. Should we be worried?\nNo major cause for alarm. HMPV is not new and spreads similarly to other respiratory viruses. Fatality rates are low (around 1%), primarily affecting vulnerable groups.","in_corpus":true,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":5,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1876269777809015193","conversation_id":"1876269772884910291"},{"id":"1876269787250327748","x":2.6e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1736172551,"iso":"2025-01-06T14:09:11Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"SlimNazi","author_id":"410902222","text":". Symptoms to watch out for:\nHMPV symptoms are like the flu or a common cold, including fever, cough, sore throat, and congestion. In severe cases, it can cause pneumonia, especially in high-risk individuals.","in_corpus":true,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":4,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1876269782800244979","conversation_id":"1876269772884910291"},{"id":"1876269792468107479","x":3.2e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1736172552,"iso":"2025-01-06T14:09:12Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"SlimNazi","author_id":"410902222","text":"5. How is it different from COVID-19?\nHMPV has been around for years and is far less contagious or deadly than COVID-19. Enhanced post-COVID testing has made such viruses more detectable, explaining the current attention.","in_corpus":true,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":3,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1876269787250327748","conversation_id":"1876269772884910291"},{"id":"1876269797006278926","x":3.9e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1736172553,"iso":"2025-01-06T14:09:13.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":5,"author":"SlimNazi","author_id":"410902222","text":"6. What can we do?\n\nFollow basic hygiene: hand washing, mask-wearing in crowded places, and covering coughs.\n\nSeek medical care if symptoms worsen, especially for children, elderly, or immunocompromised individuals.","in_corpus":false,"depth":5,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":0.002,"parent_id":"1876269792468107479","conversation_id":"1876269772884910291"},{"id":"1876269801485861058","x":4.5e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1736172554,"iso":"2025-01-06T14:09:14Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":6,"author":"SlimNazi","author_id":"410902222","text":"HMPV is part of the seasonal respiratory virus landscape.\n\n No panic, just awareness!\n\nStay informed and stay safe.","in_corpus":true,"depth":6,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.002,"parent_id":"1876269797006278926","conversation_id":"1876269772884910291"}],"edges":[{"source":"1876269772884910291","target":"1876269777809015193","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1876269772884910291","target":"1876564859476648097","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1876269772884910291","target":"1876571786860757017","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1876269772884910291","target":"1876591996787101838","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1876269772884910291","target":"1876593067341529502","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1876269772884910291","target":"1876598180382736579","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1876269772884910291","target":"1876602994474582311","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1876269772884910291","target":"1876612864997573042","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1876269772884910291","target":"1876614